  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Pick the type and size",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open Markers and pick the enemy type and size. <strong>Modifiers</strong> and <strong>Equipment</strong> beside the type add details.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/728383669ae816c8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Add modifiers",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Modifiers</strong> and tap what you saw, such as <strong>Tracked</strong>. Tap <strong>OK</strong> when done.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/77a2bce505778634.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name the equipment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Equipment</strong> and pick what you saw, such as <strong>BMP-2</strong>. Tap <strong>…</strong> to write in another type.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ebf99dd531b2502.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Say what it is doing",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick <strong>Present</strong>, <strong>Anticipated</strong> or <strong>Destroyed</strong>, and what it is doing, such as <strong>Digging in</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2d5b05ad9480ce03.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the name field and type a short name. Tap ✓ on the keyboard to close it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/35de5b79effdbb00.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Add a description",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Description</strong>, write what you saw and tap <strong>Done</strong>. Everyone you send it to sees it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/bd36db863d187698.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Place it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Place it on the map. The label shows the name and the card shows the description.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ce7dca353fec052f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
